  "title": "Great Alpine Caravans",
  "tickerText": "*** GREAT ALPINE CARAVANS ***   I started my career as a caravan builder back in 2012 where I quickly adapted to the caravan industry by learning technical knowledge with the experiences I gained working with other companies I was promoted to a team leader by gaining relevant knowledge and understanding about caravans. Gradually, I started Great Alpine caravans in 2016 because I wanted to share my perspectives and newer van build designs. Fast track to 2020 Great Alpine caravans grew to one of the leading caravan companies in Victoria.\n\nWhether the caravan build is big or small, we use state-of-the-art modern technology; Great Alpine Caravans will custom build a van as per our client’s requirements. Our main aim is to custom build a van according to your needs. We want our customers to always be satisfied with customer service and good quality RVs at affordable prices.",
